  "id": "BIT-parse-2026-109302",
  "summary": "Parse Server 8.2.2 before 8.6.94 and 9.0.0 before 9.10.1 GraphQL Schema Disclosure via Persisted Queries",
  "details": "Parse Server 8.2.2 before 8.6.94 and 9.0.0 before 9.10.1 applies its GraphQL introspection control only to operation text sent directly with a request, not to operations resolved from Apollo Server's automatic persisted query cache. Unauthenticated attackers holding the public Application Id and client key can replay an introspection query previously cached by a master or maintenance key client to retrieve the schema, including private class and field names.",
